 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>古き謎が眠る遺跡を臨む、忌まわしき地より旅は始まる。栄光と力、そして莫大な富への飽くなき渇望。その野心に突き動かされ、凶悪な魔物が潜む闇を切り拓け。呪われた深淵の先で、葬られた真実を暴くのだ。</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >共に闇を突き進め</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >最大4人の仲間とパーティを組むもよし。あるいは、死をも恐れぬ者ならば、たった一人で闇の深淵へ踏み込むがいい。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >装備を極限までカスタマイズせよ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剣、メイス、斧、ポールアーム、槍、弓、クロスボウ。多様な部品を組み合わせ、唯一無二の武器を構築せよ。すべては選択次第だ素材、色調、紋章を組み合わせ、性能と美学を追求せよ。真に自分だけの装備を作り上げるのだ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >死は、戦利品との決別を意味する</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >死はキャラクターの消滅を意味する。その身に宿したすべてを、永久に喪失するのだ。苦労して手に入れた戦利品を抱えて生還したいならば、その一歩に慎重を期せ。ベースキャンプに納めた物資だけが、真の安全を保証される。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >拠点を強化し、備えよ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ダンジョンより資源を持ち帰り、拠点を修復・強化せよ。その力を活用し、さらなる富と太古の知識を求めて次の冒険へ身を投じるのだ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >忘れ去られし地下牢を探索せよ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >悪夢の怪物、致命的な罠、崩落する構造物、隠された落とし穴、そして有毒ガス。……忠告はした。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >禁断の力に身を捧げよ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >信仰を捨て、天空界を超えて闇の神と契約を結べ。禁断の力は手に入る。だが忘れるな、すべてには対価が伴うことを。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
